OL,3,GNEWSA'Influx of rat colonies' plaguing
OL,4,Acars in cold weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car repair workshop has seen an
OL,7,F"influx" of customers bringing in
OL,8,Fvehicles infested by rats.
OL,10,FNew Again in Chelmsford, Essex, said it
OL,11,Fhas taken in five contaminated cars in
OL,12,Fa fortnight, handled further calls, and
OL,13,Fits website page about rats was getting
OL,14,F10 times more visits.
OL,16,FOwner Gary Wray, 60, who got in touch
OL,17,Fvia Your Voice, said the rats were
OL,18,Foften long gone by the time the cars
OL,19,Froll in, but their presence was marked
OL,20,Fby a trail of toxic excrement and
OL,21,Fnibbled wires under the bonnet.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
